        {
          "name": "Speak with Stones",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 5,
          "heightenedLevel": 9,
          "timesPrepared": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "earth",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "1 hour",
          "range": "",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You can ask questions of and receive answers from natural or worked stone. While stone is not intelligent, you speak with the natural spirits of the stone, which have a personality colored by the type of stone, as well as by the type of structure the stone is part of, for worked stone. A stone's perspective, perception, and knowledge give it a worldview different enough from a human's that it doesn't consider the same details important. Stones can mostly answer questions about creatures that touched them in the past and what is concealed beneath or behind them.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> The duration is 8 hours.</p>",
